Dialogue: 10,0:00:07.98,0:00:09.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's fast asleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.47,0:00:11.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That means we get some alone time.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.23,0:00:14.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Bell...!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.35,0:00:20.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shh. You'll wake the children.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.15,0:00:22.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've got time. Want another one?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.70,0:00:27.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No matter how many we have,\Nmy whole life is dedicated to you, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.55,0:00:31.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.68,0:00:37.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,G'morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.09,0:00:39.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning.\NWell, afternoon, actually.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.83,0:00:42.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's fine. It's our day off—
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.78,0:00:49.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Bell. This is my—
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.18,0:00:50.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.28,0:00:54.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You swore you'd dedicate your life to me,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.43,0:00:56.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and yet you have a child\Nwith another woman?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.90,0:00:58.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,U-Uh, Bell...?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.52,0:01:00.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, when did I say that...?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.80,0:01:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,HINATA, YOU CHEATER!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.23,0:01:07.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-Hold on a minute!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.68,0:02:10.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Natsuki?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.97,0:02:13.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mhm. She's my aunt's daughter,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.64,0:02:16.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I'm looking after her\Nuntil later this evening.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.19,0:02:19.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My mom and dad got called\Ninto work at the last minute,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.93,0:02:22.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I'm not confident on my own.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.20,0:02:24.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, I asked Sunohara for help.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.19,0:02:26.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That makes more sense.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.72,0:02:28.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, you guys.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.51,0:02:30.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't necessarily mind, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.88,0:02:35.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't have experience\Ntaking care of kids, either.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.37,0:02:38.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.45,0:02:41.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, not my hair—!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.13,0:02:43.56,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think she's curious about your hair.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.33,0:02:46.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stop that. Be a good girl, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.13,0:02:48.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.19,0:02:55.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I guess she must really like Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.14,0:02:57.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,\Nmy aunt has long hair like hers.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.78,0:03:01.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jeez... Look, I'm not your mom, so—
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.60,0:03:06.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.40,0:03:07.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Diaper change, maybe?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.79,0:03:09.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where is it...?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.22,0:03:11.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.13,0:03:11.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.48,0:03:16.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's hungry, and...\Nshe's anxious, more than anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.37,0:03:18.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Being separated from her mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.92,0:03:20.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.53,0:03:23.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Bell?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.35,0:03:26.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Well, I can't do much about\Nher empty stomach,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.96,0:03:29.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I figured this might calm her down.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.18,0:03:37.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sh-She stopped crying...?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.32,0:03:38.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y'see?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.43,0:03:39.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.55,0:03:42.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oof, she's sucking hard...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.09,0:03:43.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She must be starving.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.98,0:03:47.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura, get her food ready\Nwhile I keep her occupied.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.04,0:03:50.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On it! I'm gonna borrow your kitchen.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.41,0:03:54.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Bell.\NBut how'd you know?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.20,0:03:57.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A dark elf's intuition?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.07,0:03:58.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.62,0:04:01.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Babies' feelings are pretty straightforward,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.38,0:04:03.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so it's easy to get a sense of their mood.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.74,0:04:05.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.63,0:04:08.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can join her, if you like.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.14,0:04:09.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My left side is open.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.92,0:04:11.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll pass!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.33,0:04:12.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aw, what a shame...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.55,0:04:24.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sunohara... you perv.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.47,0:04:26.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-No! That wasn't what I...!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.15,0:04:29.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe when I'm older,\Nmine will be more...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.99,0:04:32.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? What'd you just say?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.12,0:04:33.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.47,0:04:37.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-Here, Nacchan! Food's ready!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.74,0:04:41.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, she's drinking it like crazy.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.34,0:04:43.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She must've been hungry.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.58,0:04:51.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seems like she wants to play.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.09,0:05:02.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This sure is a lot of work...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.44,0:05:03.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.89,0:05:05.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sunohara!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.01,0:05:07.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.40,0:05:09.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh my, a baby...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.45,0:05:11.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Does she belong to you two?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.85,0:05:13.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, she's not ours!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.60,0:05:16.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you like to buy something?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.75,0:05:18.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, not today.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.35,0:05:20.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe the next time there's a sale.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.58,0:05:24.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.99,0:05:26.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think she peed.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.74,0:05:27.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.16,0:05:30.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait here, Sunohara.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.08,0:05:34.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, so much!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.08,0:05:35.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're good at this.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.21,0:05:37.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My aunt taught me how to do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.25,0:05:40.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Does she belong to you two?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.51,0:05:42.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, she's not ours!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.30,0:05:46.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you teach me, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.93,0:05:48.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How to change a diaper?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.84,0:05:51.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. For future reference.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.60,0:05:54.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh, somebody's eager.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.54,0:05:56.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.09,0:05:58.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup! Slide the nappy a little farther back.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.12,0:06:06.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need a splash guard...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.58,0:06:14.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Bell?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.71,0:06:16.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.42,0:06:18.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's head back to the apartment.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.00,0:06:22.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That feels nice...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.51,0:06:28.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you sure you're alright?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.43,0:06:33.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about how you'd\Nmake a good mom, Sakura.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.16,0:06:34.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.31,0:06:39.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I used to think I wanted kids,\Nbut my confidence went out the window.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.10,0:06:41.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.54,0:06:46.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.37,0:06:49.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.80,0:06:53.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's time for her nap,\Nbut I can't get her to settle down.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.00,0:06:57.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Be a good girl, Nacchan!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.15,0:07:03.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let me do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.58,0:07:32.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's finally out.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.75,0:07:34.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell, that was amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.25,0:07:36.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shh. You'll wake her.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.83,0:07:41.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's fast asleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.34,0:07:45.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't second guess yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.19,0:07:46.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.78,0:07:49.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think you'll make a great mom, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.89,0:07:53.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.06,0:07:55.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Want to hold her?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.52,0:07:56.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.87,0:07:59.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd feel bad if I woke her up.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.14,0:08:04.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like Bell fell asleep, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.33,0:08:07.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe now would be a good time\Nto get dinner started.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.53,0:08:09.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll give you a hand.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.24,0:08:13.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think I'll make Bell's favorite tonight.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.03,0:08:15.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She worked hard looking after\Nthe baby today.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.50,0:08:19.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's sweet of you. And earlier...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.29,0:08:22.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they looked like a married couple.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.35,0:08:27.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that's what Sunohara and I\Nlook like right now...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.30,0:08:30.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mochida? Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.76,0:08:35.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sunohara, how do you feel about Bell?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.01,0:08:36.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.01,0:08:38.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is she a friend? Something more?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.15,0:08:40.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you two aren't dating, are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.66,0:08:42.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, we're not...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.91,0:08:44.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, in that case—
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.33,0:08:48.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seems like she's hungry.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.17,0:08:49.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do we have any milk?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.71,0:08:51.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'll get a bottle ready!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.78,0:08:53.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can I try giving it to her?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.49,0:08:58.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it yummy, Nacchan?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.13,0:09:01.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There, there...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.54,0:09:04.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's hope you grow up to be\Nas beautiful as your mama.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.75,0:09:06.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aw, Papa...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.39,0:09:10.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want ten more of them.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.14,0:09:13.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata, are you serious...?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.34,0:09:14.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you do it for me?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.59,0:09:15.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.47,0:09:17.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's better.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.76,0:09:21.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, what's the matter, you two?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.15,0:09:22.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.35,0:09:25.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all your help.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.77,0:09:28.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have done it without you guys.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.34,0:09:32.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No problem at all.\NIt was good experience.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.29,0:09:33.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.46,0:09:36.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still... I had fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.21,0:09:40.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.25,0:09:43.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kids, huh...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.93,0:09:45.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.67,0:09:47.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you want one of your own?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.71,0:09:48.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.63,0:09:51.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's all I could think about\Nwhile we were on baby duty.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.47,0:09:55.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"If I had children with Hinata,\Nwhat would they look like?"
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.82,0:09:58.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey—! Knock it off, Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.47,0:10:00.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.23,0:10:02.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We learned a lot today.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.23,0:10:04.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can take care of a baby.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.20,0:10:06.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not the issue!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.29,0:10:08.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, you don't believe me?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.84,0:10:10.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.00,0:10:12.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here, go ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.49,0:10:13.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.76,0:10:17.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You seemed awfully curious\Nwhen I was feeding the baby.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.62,0:10:19.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You do want a taste, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.53,0:10:21.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-No, that's not—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.43,0:10:23.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, don't be shy.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.08,0:10:26.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know how much you wove my boobs.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.06,0:10:30.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh! You use your tongue like a big boy!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.26,0:10:33.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-This isn't right...!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.44,0:10:36.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leave the parenting to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.76,0:10:41.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All you have to do, Hinata,\Nis give me lots and lots of your love.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.04,0:10:43.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll be one big happy family!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.62,0:10:45.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sh-She's intense...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.37,0:10:49.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So long as you're in the mood...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.00,0:10:52.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you and I can do it right here and now.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.12,0:10:54.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No... It's too soon...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.51,0:10:56.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Too soon? That's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.95,0:11:00.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Premature or late,\NI'll take whatever you have to offer.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.41,0:11:02.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That isn't what I meant!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.53,0:11:04.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hi-na-ta...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.88,0:11:07.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I said stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.71,0:11:10.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Sunohara, I forgot Nacchan's—
